WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.440
Greetings and goodbyes. Polite and informal ways to say hello and goodbye in Polish.

2
00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:15.870
Polish has more than one way to greet people, and the choice depends on how formal the situation is.

3
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:20.820
Dzień dobry is polite and works with people you do not know well.

4
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:29.250
Cześć is informal: it is used with friends and family, both to say hello and to say goodbye.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.240
Dzień dobry.

6
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.680
Dzień dobry.

7
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.360
It means: Good day, or hello.

8
00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.510
Polite. Used during the day.

9
00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.620
Dobry wieczór.

10
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.180
Dobry wieczór.

11
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.820
It means: Good evening.

12
00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:52.930
Polite. Used in the evening.

13
00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:55.800
Cześć!

14
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.120
Cześć!

15
00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:01.360
It means: Hi! Bye!

16
00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:04.870
Informal. For friends and family.

17
00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.860
Do widzenia.

18
00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.300
Do widzenia.

19
00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.740
It means: Goodbye.

20
00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:14.170
Polite.

21
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.080
Na razie!

22
00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:19.440
Na razie!

23
00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:22.440
It means: See you! Bye!

24
00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:24.190
Informal.

25
00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:27.460
Dobranoc.

26
00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:30.180
Dobranoc.

27
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.860
It means: Good night.

28
00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:37.490
Said when saying goodnight, not as a general goodbye.

29
00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:40.880
Let's recap.

30
00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:42.470
Dzień dobry.

31
00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:44.430
Dobry wieczór.

32
00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:46.150
Cześć!

33
00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:47.990
Do widzenia.

34
00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:49.750
Na razie!

35
00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:51.870
Dobranoc.

36
00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:58.710
